  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_73e18036-5546-4f2d-9813-640cafe26d03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"839\" height=\"352\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"line-height:40.6px;text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_f22a3936-1f7b-4eab-ab9a-a1d370b4d9d0.png\" width=\"886\" height=\"245\"></strong></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HXsBBYbQsE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_d731138a-ff4e-47b6-bef7-58da20c73038.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"139\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/MiauczelsMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px;float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_063588f7-27ee-47a1-9610-4709540c5958.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"130\"></a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">YouTube 抢先预览：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@miaucze7991\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@miaucze7991</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">《传奇怪物》（Legendary Monsters）是一款旨在为游戏添加具有专属背景故事的强力Boss，并在世界中散布小型迷你Boss的模组。<br><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_47ac74a5-0d7d-4749-b624-d5b238fab9c7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"263\"></p>\n<p>以及《Biomes We Gone》</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>与群系、战斗机制类模组的兼容性：</p>\n<p>需要 Epic Fight（史诗战斗）的兼容支持吗？试试这款出色的模组，它能为 Epic Fight 添加兼容支持！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-legendary-monsters-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-legendary-monsters-epicfight</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鸣谢：</p>\n<p>Bf_Meow 制作了精美的纹理贴图。</p>\n<p>StarJumpXY2334 制作了出色的动画精灵图。</p>\n<p>L_Enders_Cataclysm 分享了源代码，我参考了其中的渲染模块、复杂数学运算及动画系统，并借此在 Java 编程方面学到了很多。</p>\n<p>感谢“Obliteration”级别的赞助者：</p>\n<p>| Voidra | Anthony | Lib | Water333111000| 510 pentagon | Crimson7Cookie | FLOOPY R.G | lilp382 | Rimas |</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
